&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;f84fc78d-4612-4ab3-b175-12ca6bf33a26&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in optical assembly, micro-assembly, or precision electronics manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
