&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Office (Excel, Outlook, Word)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;9a72c351-e81e-497b-b07c-835550557702&quot;&gt;Eligible to obtain and maintain a United States Security Clearance&lt;/li&gt;
