&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Duties:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create, execute, and operationalize instructor-led training (virtual/in-person) for customers and partners. Design, build, and operationalize program capabilities, frameworks,&amp;nbsp;and metrics. Harmonize cross-functional teams and subject matter experts to ensure ongoing&amp;nbsp;alignment with programs. Collaborate with stakeholders to create engaging learning activities&amp;nbsp;and compelling curriculum to enhance retention and drive customer outcomes. Maintain and&amp;nbsp;update training materials in response to product updates and changes. Develop advanced&amp;nbsp;instructor-led training materials. Recommend improvements to Workato&#39;s education services. Stay up to date with industry tools and technologies to improve the virtual and in-person training&amp;nbsp;experience. Work with cross-functional teams to deliver a comprehensive suite of instructor-led&amp;nbsp;events, targeting different customer personas and skill levels. Adapt training delivery methods to&amp;nbsp;accommodate various personas. Assess student practical exercises. Track and analyze key&amp;nbsp;performance indicators (KPIs) such as surveys, Instructor Utilization, registration to&amp;nbsp;participation, passed exams, and testimonials. Full-time telecommuting permitted from&amp;nbsp;anywhere in the U.S. Travel throughout the U.S. every few months for 1-5 days at a time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree, or foreign equivalent, in Computer Information Systems, Engineering, or related field plus five (5) years of progressively responsible experience in job offered or as a Solutions Consultant, Automation Consultant or related&lt;br&gt;occupation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Special Skill Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience communicating with Technical and Business stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working in an iPaaS/SaaS organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience documenting business processes and applying technology to&amp;nbsp;optimize and automate these processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of operating models, SDLC, security, and governance in large&amp;nbsp;enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of key applications such as Salesforce, NetSuite, Workday,&amp;nbsp;ServiceNow, SAP, EBusiness Suite, and Databases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $133,266.00-175,000.00 per annum. 40 hours per week; M-F, 9:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must be legally authorized to work in the U.S. without sponsorship&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-DNP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

